WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
- I got stopped outside and asked

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.419
"Will you put this pill in your mouth,

00:00:03.419 --> 00:00:05.368
"get it all over your tongue,
and then eat a donut?"

00:00:05.368 --> 00:00:08.255
(funky upbeat music)

00:00:08.255 --> 00:00:09.919
- So this is Crave Crush.

00:00:09.919 --> 00:00:12.401
They're these little minty
tablets that apparently

00:00:12.401 --> 00:00:15.338
stop you from tasting
sugar for up to an hour.

00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:17.063
So I'm gonna go out and buy some donuts

00:00:17.063 --> 00:00:19.021
and have my coworkers test them out

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:20.945
and let's see if this actually works.

00:00:20.945 --> 00:00:22.590
Maybe it'll just ruin
donuts for them forever

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.586
and I'm just a terrible person.

00:00:24.586 --> 00:00:27.264
But I already know that.

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:29.432
- I can't taste sugar for an hour?

00:00:29.432 --> 00:00:30.564
- It smells like a mint.

00:00:30.564 --> 00:00:33.293
- Annie has donuts, so I want
a donut so (bleep)ing badly.

00:00:33.293 --> 00:00:35.876
(upbeat music)

00:00:37.241 --> 00:00:38.411
- Tastes like a mint.

00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:39.822
- Ow, God, my tongue.

00:00:39.822 --> 00:00:43.025
It's the taste of a numbing
solution without numbness.

00:00:43.025 --> 00:00:45.428
- I can like pop one of
these in right after a meal.

00:00:45.428 --> 00:00:48.664
I'll have fresh breath
and I won't want sugar.

00:00:48.664 --> 00:00:50.063
Hopefully.

00:00:50.063 --> 00:00:52.103
- (gasps) Oh, beautiful!

00:00:52.103 --> 00:00:54.023
- Okay, I got this maple donut.

00:00:54.023 --> 00:00:57.096
I didn't know there would be
maple donuts and I love maple.

00:00:57.096 --> 00:00:59.255
(upbeat music)

00:00:59.255 --> 00:01:02.285
- Yeah, I don't taste the sweetness.

00:01:02.285 --> 00:01:05.535
- It's like soft, like semi-sweet bread

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:08.761
and I don't taste the chocolate.

00:01:08.761 --> 00:01:10.186
- No, that's still awesome.

00:01:10.186 --> 00:01:12.135
- This is so gross.

00:01:12.135 --> 00:01:15.873
- I do taste sugar, but it's not as, like,

00:01:15.873 --> 00:01:18.373
overwhelming as it usually is.

00:01:19.494 --> 00:01:20.696
- Is it sweet?

00:01:20.696 --> 00:01:22.555
- Yeah, it's a donut.
- Yeah.

00:01:22.555 --> 00:01:24.294
I don't taste the sweetness.
- What?

00:01:24.294 --> 00:01:25.508
- I don't think it worked.

00:01:25.508 --> 00:01:27.297
- This is gonna ruin
everything for me now.

00:01:27.297 --> 00:01:29.238
- A+, Crave Crush.

00:01:29.238 --> 00:01:32.405
(funky upbeat music)

